  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At crescent lake, Yan Tribe offers Water Demon Hao Ji Liu a rank five storage Gu packed with primeval stones as part of a ransom. While he is inspecting those stones, Immobilization Gu flies out from among them and crashes onto him at breakneck speed. Yan Tian Ji shouts for the strike, and Hao Ji Liu stays unable to move as Yan tribe elders surround him and Fang Yuan’s wolf group emerges from nearby woodland.",
